==Requirement Strategies==
*For the first and second requirements, focus on picking up [[Research Capsule]]/[[Pumpkin]] and extracting [[Machine]]. The Machine, Capsule and Pumpkin count increases the further you descend, so you can earn more [[Ichor]] and Pumpkins.
*For the third requirement, have a Distractor [[Toon]] bring {{CI|Twisted Gourdy|name=true}} to the elevator to you so you can get aggro. Playing as {{CI|Rodger|name=true}} also helps getting Research faster because of his Passive [[Ability]]. This will be easier if Twisted Gourdy is on the [[Daily Twisted Board]]. Or, as Twisted Gourdy is guaranteed to spawn on floor 20, do a solo run, or a run with other people who know the goal, and get to floor 20 to guarantee research.
