==Trivia==
*Gourdy and {{CI|Soulvester|name=true}} are the first [[Toons]] to have retroactive 5 {{Star}} in two [[Stats]] (both sharing [[Skill Check]] and Extraction Speed).
**This trait also gives them the highest base extractability in-game.
**They are also the only Toons to have 1 Star in two Stats.
*Gourdy's last name is Holloway, confirmed in various dialogues from him.
**His last name is a mix on the words Holiday and Halloween.
***It is also similar to the surname "Halloway".<ref>https://www.houseofnames.com/uk/halloway-family-crest</ref>
**His last name is also in one of the [[Show]]'s Episode titles, being called "Holloway Haunting".
**He is the first [[Holiday Toons|Event]] {{Type|Main}} [[Toon]] to have his last name revealed immediately after his release.
***His last name was revealed by his dialogues and the "Holloway Haunting" Poster, meanwhile {{CI|Bobette|name=true}} and {{CI|Bassie|name=true}}'s last names were revealed in [[Qwel]]'s livestreams.
*Gourdy is the second [[Toon]] to be a child, with the first being {{CI|Toodles|name=true}}.
**Gourdy and Toodles are also friends, which makes sense considering they are both children and therefore would likely relate to each other more and/or have similar interests.
**However, with Toodles' [[Introduction Card]] showing Toodles as the youngest Toon in [[Gardenview]], this technically means Gourdy is the second youngest.
**Additionally, he is the first [[Main Character]] and male Toon to be a child.
*Unlike other [[Holiday Main Characters]], Gourdy does not have an established relationship with the Event {{Type|Rare}} ({{CI|Eclipse|name=true}}), instead he appears to be closer to [[Soulvester]]. 
**They play pretend, Gourdy looks up to Soulvester, and Soulvester speaks to Gourdy as if he were royalty. If the short is canon, "Found in the woods 🗡️" also shows Soulvester comforting and hugging Gourdy after the latter's revelation of his nonexistent (or possibly disposed of) [[Minor Characters|parents]]. These all point to Soulvester possibly acting as a guardian towards Gourdy.
***If the aforementioned short is canon, this would also mean Soulvester is the first known [[Toon]] to have explicitly prevented another Toon from becoming [[Twisted]], as his comfort seemed to prevent Gourdy's breakdown from leading into transformation.
*Gourdy is the second [[Toon]] to have eyes that do not have white sclerae and black pupils, with the first being {{CI|Vee|name=true}}.
*Gourdy is the only [[Toon]] to have inset eyes. This makes him as if he's looking at the viewer's perspective from multiple angles. 
**This might have been inspired by the pre-release version of {{CI|Dandy|name=true}}.
*Gourdy is the only [[Holiday Toons|Event]] [[Main Character]] [[Toon]] whose [[Mastery]] does not include reaching [[Floor]] 20.
*Gourdy is the third [[Main Character]] [[Toon]] to have 1 Star on at least one of their stats, the first being {{CI|Pebble|name=true}} with his 1 Star Extraction Speed and the second being [[Bassie]] with her 1 Star Skill Check.
*Gourdy is one of the 4 [[Toons]] to lack a 3 Star Stat, the others being [[Bassie]], {{CI|Shrimpo|name=true}}, and {{CI|Waxwell|name=true}}.
*Gourdy is the third [[Holiday Main Character]] to be released, the first and second being [[Bobette]] and [[Bassie]].
**Additionally, he is the first and only Holiday Main Character to be male.
**In-fact, he is the first Holiday Main to have Gossips.
**Gourdy is currently the only Holiday Main Character to not have 2 Star Extraction Speed.
*Gourdy shares the same [[Ability]] sound with [[Bassie]].
*Gourdy, alongside [[Shrimpo]], [[Soulvester]], and {{CI|Boxten|name=true}} have concept art hidden in their [[Halloween Event#Skins|Halloween Event Skin]] texture sheets. Fresh Fall Gourdy's concept art can also be seen in Boxten's texture sheet.
**Fresh Fall is the only Skin to be unintentionally leaked prior to release. Infected Candy {{CI|Yatta|name=true}} was also technically leaked, however the design was made by a developer prior to being in the dev team.
*Gourdy is the third [[Toon]] to have visible fingers, after {{CI|Goob|name=true}} and {{CI|Scraps|name=true}}.
**Additionally, his hands are very similar to Goob's.
*Gourdy is the first [[Toon]] to have an official song in collaboration with the YouTuber [https://www.youtube.com/@CG5/videos CG5] called [[Locked Away]].
*Gourdy is the first [[Toon]] in general to have confirmed biological parents, currently known as [[Mr & Mrs Holloway]].
**He carries a mix of his parents' features, taking:
***Mr Holloway's hand and feet paws, mouth shape, and the light green claws, tail leaf color, and arms.
***Mrs Holloway's head shape, tail color, and feet type.
***Both of Mr Holloway and Mrs Holloway's body colors, making a lighter shade of orange.
***Both of Mr Holloway and Mrs Holloway's stem leaves and leg colors with them being a light to dark green gradient.
***The only trait not inherited was the stem leaf amount being 1 instead of 2, though likely due to his youth.
*Gourdy is the first [[Holiday Toon]] who is shown to not be running away from a [[Twisted]] in the thumbnails, instead playing with [[Toodles]], followed by [[Soulvester]], who appears giving [[Twisted Gourdy]] a {{II|Stealth Candy|name=true}}.
*His name, Gourdy, is a reference to the word gourd, which means a hard-shelled fruit part of the {{wp|Cucurbitaceae}} family, which include pumpkins.
**Additionally, while Gourdy's legs look like pumpkin vines, they can also be interpreted as looking a bit like small cucumbers or some other green organism from said family, which gives him a stronger connection to gourds as a whole, even while he himself is a pumpkin.
*He is the second [[Toon]] to get a marketable plushie, the first being [[Dandy]].
**Additionally, he's the first [[Holiday Toon]] to have one.
*If you play as Gourdy and enter the secret bedroom and stay in it for a few seconds, his dialogue will pop up saying "{{Text|I shouldn't stay here much longer...}}", which in turn makes him the second playable [[Toon]] with dialogue without using [[Ability]] or being in the [[Elevator]].
*Gourdy seems to like drawing, as seen in {{CI|Ribecca|name=true}}'s dialogue, his gossip about {{CI|Brusha|name=true}}, and in the [[Locked Away]] music video.
*Gourdy is the second [[Toon]] to be teased in-game before their release, as seen in {{CI|Dyle|name=true}}'s gossip dialogue talking about [[Toodles]], with {{CI|Blot|name=true}} being the first Toon.
**[[Yatta]] could also count, being slightly hinted through one of {{CI|Looey|name=true}}'s dialogues with {{CI|Teagan|name=true}}.
**Additionally, he is the first [[Holiday Toon]] and [[Main Character]] to be teased this way.
