*Gourdy is one of the 5 [[Toons]] to have a flaccid tail, with the first Toons being [[Vee]] and [[Scraps]], the second being {{CI|Connie|name=true}} (debatable) and the third being [[Yatta]].
*Gourdy's Lost Prince [[Skin]] has a slightly different idle fidget than his other Skins. In his other Skins his head seems to tilt towards the side of whichever one of his hands go up, but in his Lost Prince Skin the side his head tilts towards seems to align (movement wise) with his hands.
**If the situation calls for it, it is a common feature for Skins to have slightly different animations or positions as to not interfere with additionally added features (e.g Fairy Godmother [[Shrimpo]] has his arms further apart to not touch the dress, to avoid his arms clipping in the skirt), though why it is different and whether or not it is an instance of this is unknown.
*Funnily enough, Gourdy gets paler with the release of each of his [[Skins]] (excluding Vintage), with Midnight Sleeper having him slightly pale, Crinkling Leaves making the paleness more noticeable, Lost Prince making him a noticeable palish-yellowish color, and finally Fresh Fall having a similar limeish color.
*Gourdy, [[Eclipse]], and [[Soulvester]] are the first [[Holiday Toons]] to have more than 1 Holiday [[Skin]], having 4, 3, and 2 respectively.
*Gourdy has the most amount of [[Event]] [[Skins]], with 6, tying with [[Bobette]] and {{CI|Ginger|name=true}}.
*Gourdy's [[Skins]] may be based on his [[Gourdy's Parents|parents]], with the colors and traits on some of them looking quite similar to them, or allude to them in some way.
